OL,3,GNEWSAThalidomide survivor given minutes
OL,4,Ato live as a baby takes to the skies
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Teresa Smith was born nearly 66
OL,7,Fyears ago at just 28 weeks, with no
OL,8,Flegs and short arms, it was feared she
OL,9,Fwould only live for a couple of
OL,10,Fminutes.
OL,12,FHaving been delivered at her parents'
OL,13,Fhome in Walton, Merseyside, on 12
OL,14,FOctober 1960, Teresa was immediately
OL,15,Frushed to hospital by a midwife,
OL,16,Ftransported in the warm pocket of her
OL,17,Ffather's overcoat.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
