OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThalidomide survivor given minutes
OL,4,Ato live as a baby takes to the skies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA survivor of Thalidomide - one of the
OL,7,Fworld's biggest drug scandals - Teresa
OL,8,Fspent much of her first two-and-a-half
OL,9,Fyears receiving lifesaving treatment at
OL,10,FAlder Hey hospital.
OL,12,FSixty-five years later, the retired
OL,13,Fsocial worker is poised to pilot a
OL,14,Fcharity flight to raise money for
OL,15,Ftoday's generation of premature babies.
